        {
          "text": "Na rĩrĩ, aya nĩo andũ a bũrũri arĩa maacookire kuuma bũrũri ũrĩa maatahĩirwo, arĩa Mũthamaki Nebukadinezaru wa Babuloni aatahĩte akamatwara Babuloni (nao magĩcooka Jerusalemu na Juda, o mũndũ itũũra-inĩ rĩake,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
